// xoshiro256** follows Blackman--Vigna's public-domain reference exactly for
// next(); each thread is filled by four SplitMix64 outputs.  bounded() uses
// rejection, so modulo reduction has no bias.  Batch output is one stable
// aggregate per 256-thread group, not one record per trajectory.
